              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne nkanu ya ku luhangu, ne nkanu ya ku tshibi tshia luhangu, ne milonda yonso ya mu nsubu, ne milonda yonso ya mu luhangu lua ku muaba wa tshitendelelu.",
          "type": "text",
